{
  "id": "a-famosa-gate",
  "name": "A Famosa Fortress Gate",
  "notes": [
    "THIS SCREEN IS ABOUT SCALE. The art critique's finding was that nothing in",
    "the game is bigger than the player; here that has to be conspicuously false",
    "in the first half second. The curtain wall stands 112px against a 32px",
    "player (3.5x), the gatehouse 176px (5.5x) and its parapet leaves the top of",
    "the frame. The arch is 66px tall and 44 wide — a horseman rides through it —",
    "and the plaza lies in the wall's shade for the first third of its depth.",
    "",
    "MATERIAL. A Famosa was built of LATERITE, quarried red-brown out of the hill",
    "behind it, dressed with granite at the arch and the string courses. That is",
    "what stops this screen reading as the same grey as St Paul's and what puts a",
    "warm mass against the sky.",
    "",
    "DEPTH PLANES. 1) the rooftops and the bell tower of the fortress town seen",
    "OVER the wall, hazed. 2) the wall, the gatehouse, the flanking towers, the",
    "guns and the plaza. 3) the two houses of the lower town at the bottom",
    "corners plus the palms, emitted as walk-behind overlays.",
    "",
    "CULTURE MARKERS: the Cross of the Order of Christ on the escutcheon and on",
    "the padrao, the royal banner on the west tower, the pelourinho in the plaza",
    "(every Portuguese praca had one), and the bronze guns on garrison carriages."
  ],
